      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/Greenhorn,_Oregon"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Gold mining in Greenhorn ceased around 1942 due to economic factors and a federal wartime ban on mining.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
